    "inputs": "stream.tensor.import into !stream.resource<external>",
    "outputs": "stream.resource.alloca of kind <external>: the ALLOCATED SLAB, not the sum of the output tensors. For a multi-output model IREE packs the results into one slab and splits it with subviews, so this over-counts (measured: a 128 B slab for 32+16 B of outputs). Over-counting is sound; the name 'output buffer' would not be accurate.",
